	(text_box "Note: \nStandard PWM mode is routed to any CCPx pin.\nEnhanced PWM mode has five modes:\n• Single PWM\n• Half-Bridge PWM\n• Full-Bridge PWM, Forward Mode\n• Full-Bridge PWM, Reverse Mode\n• Single PWM with PWM Steering Mode\n\nOUTPUTs are routed to PxA, PxB, PxC, PxD pins"
